      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3 payment Modules\n\n1. Free tier - 3rd party friend request \n\n- Visible profiles\n- visible status/reels\n- can receive friend request and accept it\n\n2. basic tier - messaging, receive and request friends,\nvideo call, \n\n3. pro tier - UI \n\n4. custom tier - custom UI",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3 payment Modules\n\n1. Free tier - 3rd party friend request \n\n- Visible profiles\n- visible status/reels\n- can receive friend request and accept it\n\n2. basic tier - messaging, receive and request friends,\nvideo call, \n\n3. pro tier - UI \n\n4. custom tier - custom UI",
